                <h2 rtrvr-ls="5~hs,6~hs,8~hs,9~hs,49~hs" rtrvr-ro="42">The Modern Gamaka</h2><p>In underground music dens and bustling festival stages across South India, a sonic revolution is underway. Young virtuosos trained in rigorous Tyagaraja kirtis are picking up five-string electric violins, digital synthesizers, and konnakol voice processors.</p>
              
              
              
